{"seq":1,"slug":"organizational-behavior-grad","title":"组织行为学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad","introMarkdown":"# 组织行为学 简介\n\n组织行为学是管理学的核心基础学科，运用心理学、社会学和人类学等多学科视角研究组织中人的行为规律。在研究生阶段，这一领域的学习从描述性认识进入理论建构和实证检验层面，要求学习者具备独立分析组织现象和评价研究证据的能力。\n\n本课程按照从微观到宏观的分析层次展开，涵盖个体、群体和组织三个维度，并以研究方法论作为贯穿全程的方法工具。\n\n第一章**个体行为**深入分析组织中个体行为的心理基础，探讨动机理论从经典需求层次到自我决定理论的演进脉络、人格特质与工作行为的匹配关系，以及个体决策中的认知偏误和有限理性。\n\n第二章**群体与团队**聚焦人际互动和集体行为的动态过程，涵盖团队组建、发展和效能的理论模型、从特质论到变革型领导的领导力理论演变，以及冲突的功能性与破坏性分析及谈判策略。\n\n第三章**组织层面行为**将视角提升至组织整体，讨论组织文化的形成机制和类型诊断、组织变革的阻力来源和管理策略，以及权力的基础与组织政治行为的正当性边界。\n\n第四章**组织行为研究方法**培养开展学术研究的方法论能力，讲解多层次研究设计在嵌套数据分析中的应用、纵向研究在捕捉组织动态变化中的优势，以及跨文化研究中的等价性和比较性问题。\n\n建议学习者在阅读经典文献的同时注重对理论假设的批判性反思，组织行为学的深度学习不仅在于理解已有理论，更在于发现现有解释的不足之处。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"individual","title":"个体行为","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/individual","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"motivation-theories","title":"研究生 组织行为学 — 动机理论","url":"/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/individual/motivation-theories"},{"seq":2,"slug":"personality-and-work","title":"研究生 组织行为学 — 人格与工作","url":"/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/individual/personality-and-work"},{"seq":3,"slug":"decision-making-in-organizations","title":"研究生 组织行为学 — 组织决策","url":"/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/individual/decision-making-in-organizations"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"group","title":"群体与团队","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/group","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"team-dynamics","title":"研究生 组织行为学 — 团队动力学","url":"/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/group/team-dynamics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"leadership-theories","title":"研究生 组织行为学 — 领导力理论","url":"/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/group/leadership-theories"},{"seq":3,"slug":"conflict-negotiation","title":"研究生 组织行为学 — 冲突与谈判","url":"/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/group/conflict-negotiation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"organizational","title":"组织层面行为","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/organizational","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"organizational-culture","title":"研究生 组织行为学 — 组织文化","url":"/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/organizational/organizational-culture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"organizational-change","title":"研究生 组织行为学 — 组织变革","url":"/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/organizational/organizational-change"},{"seq":3,"slug":"power-politics","title":"研究生 组织行为学 — 权力与组织政治","url":"/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/organizational/power-politics"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"research-methods","title":"组织行为研究方法","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/research-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-level-research","title":"研究生 组织行为学 — 多层次研究方法","url":"/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/research-methods/multi-level-research"},{"seq":2,"slug":"longitudinal-studies-ob","title":"研究生 组织行为学 — 纵向研究设计","url":"/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/research-methods/longitudinal-studies-ob"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-cultural-ob-research","title":"研究生 组织行为学 — 跨文化组织行为研究","url":"/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/research-methods/cross-cultural-ob-research"}]}]}